# Installed next to .cursor/ (workspace root). Keeps local secrets out of Agent context.
# See docs/ai/agent-customization-layers.md

# Env / keys (also .gitignore)
.env
.env.*
*.pem

# Signing material (local only)
*.p12
*.mobileprovision
*.cer

# Large or machine-local Xcode output
DerivedData/
**/DerivedData/
build/
**/build/
